    "biography": "<p><strong>Movement Rate:</strong> 4/16</p><p><strong>Skills:</strong> Clubs 50, Fray 40, Perception 50 (60), Psi Assault 50, Unarmed Combat 60</p><p><strong>Traits:</strong> Psi (Level 2)</p><p><strong>Attacks:</strong> Club (DV 1d10 + 5, AP 0), Unarmed (DV 1d10 + 3, AP 0)</p><p><strong>Suggested Sleights:</strong> Ambience Sense, Grok, Mindlink, Onslaught, Psychic Stab, Static</p><p><em>Printed: INIT 70, SPD 1, LUC 20, TT 4, IR 40, DUR 35, WT 7, DR 53.</em></p><p><em>Source: Eclipse Phase Gatecrashing, p. 176.</em></p>",
