        "strainPerAP": false,
        "skill": "psiAssault",
        "damage": "1d10 + ceil(@wil / 10)",
        "harm": "damage",
        "exsurgent": false,
        "active": false,
        "remaining": 0,
        "description": "<p>Psychic Stab is an offensive sleight that seeks to inflict physical damage on the target’s brain and nervous system. Each successful attack inflicts 1d10 + (WIL ÷ 10, round up) damage. Increase the damage by +5 if an Excellent Success is scored.</p><p><em>Source: Eclipse Phase Core Rulebook, p. 228.</em></p>"
      },
